  73:../src/middleware/bacnet/src/dcc.c **** /* When the initiation of communications is disabled,
  74:../src/middleware/bacnet/src/dcc.c ****    all APDUs shall be processed and responses returned as
  75:../src/middleware/bacnet/src/dcc.c ****    required and no messages shall be initiated with the
  76:../src/middleware/bacnet/src/dcc.c ****    exception of I-Am requests, which shall be initiated only in
  77:../src/middleware/bacnet/src/dcc.c ****    response to Who-Is messages. In this state, a device that
  78:../src/middleware/bacnet/src/dcc.c ****    supports I-Am request initiation shall send one I-Am request
  79:../src/middleware/bacnet/src/dcc.c ****    for any Who-Is request that is received if and only if
  80:../src/middleware/bacnet/src/dcc.c ****    the Who-Is request does not contain an address range or
  81:../src/middleware/bacnet/src/dcc.c ****    the device is included in the address range. */
